            {
              "textRaw": "as(str)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "as",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>str</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 带数字声调的拼音字符串</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将 <code>zhong1</code> / <code>lü4</code> / <code>nv3</code> 等数字声调写法转换为声调符号写法.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(pinyin4j.as(&#39;zhong1wen2&#39;)); // zhōngwén\nconsole.log(pinyin4j.as(&#39;nv3&#39;)); // nǚ\n</code></pre>\n",
